<Layout title="Transparencia y Registro Web DIAN" description="Consulta la información institucional, el balance inicial, los documentos de la Fundación Pedro Franco y el estado del trámite ante la DIAN." label="Transparencia DIAN">
<main class="w-full bg-background min-h-screen page-content transparencia" id="contenido"><div class="flex flex-col w-full">

<div class="relative w-full overflow-hidden">
<div class="absolute -top-32 right-1/4 w-96 h-96 rounded-full bg-secondary-container/20 blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>
<div class="absolute top-96 -left-20 w-80 h-80 rounded-full bg-tertiary-fixed/30 blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>

<section class="max-w-[1320px] mx-auto px-margin pt-12 pb-8 w-full">
<div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-end justify-between gap-space-lg pb-space-lg border-b-0">
<div class="max-w-3xl space-y-space-sm">
<div class="inline-flex items-center gap-space-xs px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-surface-container-high text-primary font-label-statutory text-label-statutory uppercase tracking-widest shadow-sm">
<span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-secondary animate-pulse"></span>
<span>Auditoría Abierta · Ley ESAL Colombia</span>
</div>
<h1 class="font-display-lg text-display-lg text-primary tracking-tight">
            Transparencia y Registro Web
          </h1>
<p class="font-body-lg text-body-lg text-on-surface-variant max-w-2xl leading-relaxed">
            Cumplimiento normativo, apertura documental y rigor ético en cada recurso destinado al bienestar y bioética fina felina en Medellín.
          </p>
</div>

<div class="flex flex-col gap-2 p-space-md bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-xl shadow-md min-w-[280px]">
<div class="flex items-center justify-between text-on-surface-variant">
<span class="font-label-md text-label-md">Vigilancia Administrativa</span>
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px] text-secondary" aria-hidden="true">gavel</span>
</div>
<div class="font-title-md text-title-md text-primary">CCMA &amp; Alcaldía de Medellín</div>
<div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 font-label-statutory text-label-statutory text-on-secondary-container bg-secondary-container/40 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md">
