              </p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="flex-shrink-0 flex items-center gap-2 text-on-tertiary-fixed-variant bg-tertiary-fixed/60 px-4 py-2.5 rounded-lg shadow-sm font-label-md text-label-md">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[20px]" aria-hidden="true">verified_user</span>
<span>Principio de Veracidad y Fe Pública</span>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

